# Gradle build artifacts
/build/
/.gradle/
/out/

# The root .gitignore has a blanket `*.jar` rule. The Gradle wrapper JAR MUST be
# committed, otherwise `./gradlew` cannot bootstrap on a fresh clone (Gradle is
# not installed on the build machines). Rules in a nested .gitignore override
# those in a parent, so this re-includes it.
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
